00:12:34.560 --> 00:12:38.803
I want to buy Rolling Rock
for $230 million from InBev,

00:12:38.803 --> 00:12:41.470
ABI InBev, and then sell it to MillerCoors

00:12:41.470 --> 00:12:44.190
