00:12:48.410 --> 00:12:50.690
- I would change, well
liquor ,let's leave out,

00:12:50.690 --> 00:12:51.560
'cause the three tier system,

00:12:51.560 --> 00:12:54.900
but let's say, let's use Head &amp; Shoulders.

00:12:54.900 --> 00:12:57.000
I would become disproportionately capable

00:12:57.000 --> 00:13:00.290
at Amazon and Shopify, and
I would not spend money

00:13:00.290 --> 00:13:02.630
on television and print
and programmatic digital,

00:13:02.630 --> 00:13:05.140
and I would spend it on
Facebook and Instagram,

00:13:05.140 --> 00:13:06.880
and original media like podcasting.

00:13:06.880 --> 00:13:09.920
I would contemporize the business

00:13:09.920 --> 00:13:12.800
around nostalgia or legacy brand.

00:13:12.800 --> 00:13:14.850
- And how would you create
a direct relationship

00:13:14.850 --> 00:13:15.960
with the consumer?

00:13:15.960 --> 00:13:18.320
- By creating one through
marketing and comms,

00:13:18.320 --> 00:13:20.983
which is actually marketing
where they actually are.

00:13:22.520 --> 00:13:23.830
That's the punchline here.

00:13:23.830 --> 00:13:24.663
- [Ken] Right.

00:13:24.663 --> 00:13:25.640
- Like the way they score,

00:13:25.640 --> 00:13:27.800
the margin is in television
and programmatic,

00:13:27.800 --> 00:13:30.300
that's why those five
holding companies sell that.

