they actually don't see it.

00:14:31.340 --> 00:14:33.560
And they don't see it Ken.

00:14:33.560 --> 00:14:35.190
- When you ask the a-ha moments,

00:14:35.190 --> 00:14:38.570
that's certainly one of them,
the blindness of people,

00:14:38.570 --> 00:14:41.090
and related to that is
the insecurity of people.

00:14:41.090 --> 00:14:41.923
They don't see it.

00:14:41.923 --> 00:14:43.280
- And the audacity.

00:14:43.280 --> 00:14:46.050
Ken, how much audacity's in the system?

00:14:46.050 --> 00:14:49.400
- Well, there's habits in the system.

00:14:49.400 --> 00:14:50.233
