fundamentally threatened,

00:15:05.420 --> 00:15:06.700
there's insecurity.

00:15:06.700 --> 00:15:09.790
They're aware that they
don't have the same pay level

00:15:09.790 --> 00:15:11.540
to attract people the way a Facebook

00:15:11.540 --> 00:15:13.480
and Google does for instance.

00:15:13.480 --> 00:15:17.210
Well this insecurity, the
mistrust that the clients have

00:15:17.210 --> 00:15:22.210
for the agencies, and there's
insecurity about the math men

00:15:22.890 --> 00:15:24.480
taking over from the mad men.

00:15:24.480 --> 00:15:25.313
