00:55:47.620 --> 00:55:48.453
Reputation?

00:55:48.453 --> 00:55:49.397
- Yeah.

00:55:49.397 --> 00:55:51.530
Current reputation that only grow.

00:55:51.530 --> 00:55:54.190
You know, I wanna be the
reverse of Christopher Columbus.

00:55:54.190 --> 00:55:55.023
I mean that.

00:55:55.023 --> 00:55:56.650
I know who I am.

00:55:56.650 --> 00:55:58.610
